    q.explain = String(q.explain || "").replace(/<\/p>\s*$/, "") + `</p><p><strong>Why the other approaches fail:</strong> ${alternatives} <strong>Educational takeaway:</strong> Name the dominant physiology, correct reversible causes, choose support that fits the failing chamber or vascular tone, and confirm recovery with independent perfusion measures.</p>`;
